    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming Three-Bedroom Bungalow in a Peaceful Rural Setting\r\nNestled in the heart of the picturesque Tipperary countryside, just minutes from the welcoming village of Dundrum, this charming single-storey three-bedroom residence offers the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nSet in a peaceful location, the property enjoys easy access to a range of scenic walking trails, including the beautiful Marl Bog woodland and lakeside walks, making it an ideal home for nature lovers and outdoor enthusiasts."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The residence provides comfortable single-storey living with bright, well-proportioned accommodation, offering excellent potential for families, retirees or anyone seeking a relaxed country lifestyle.  A standout feature of this property is the large workshop, ideally suited to a skilled tradesperson, hobbyist, or anyone in need of substantial workspace. Offering excellent storage and working capacity, it provides endless potential for a variety of uses including woodworking, mechanical work, craft production or home-based enterprise.\r\n\r\nDespite its idyllic setting, the property is within a comfortable commuting distance of both Thurles and Tipperary Town, providing convenient access to schools, shops, employment centres and transport links.\r\nCombining the charm of country living with excellent accessibility, abundant nearby natural amenities, and the added benefit of a substantial workshop, this is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy life in one of County Tipperary's most attractive locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Notice:\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      }
    ],
